      {
        "author_name": "Amy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103294297127902848682/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIsglVdTQhV0RHjSrt9wF-xnmjzE6Xu60x_niaOBktDyCQazQMS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "After three visits to our home, I can confirm that the staff is professional, meticulous, and extremely fast, never overlooking details. We were impressed! They were also very flexible, which helps when you work from home.\nThe owner was also impeccable during our onboarding as a client. She took the time to thoroughly explain how the service works, patiently answered all our questions, and demonstrated great professionalism. I highly recommend this cleaning service to anyone looking for quality, reliable, and efficient service.",
        "time": 1759332661,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Roy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114115728887861923083/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7WhL0FXw4TKJyoZpps9CveFTRaSjC-H9CwSH4WX5JuR_Hxg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Hello,\nI would like to thank Priscilla for her excellent service and product knowledge. We made a wonderful discovery at the Eden boutique. We purchased the \"Pure\" household products, the mint degreaser, which is fantastic and smells so good, and the stainless steel polish, which leaves the product shiny and clean... like a new refrigerator! :) The balsamic vinegar is delicious dipped with olive oil and fresh bread. We will definitely be returning to the boutique for personal purchases and Christmas gifts!",
        "time": 1700606686,
        "translated": true
      },
